**Public browse (`GET /api/hostels?collegeId=1&sortBy=distance`)**
```
HostelController.search
  → HostelService.search
      → HostelSpecifications.{minPrice,maxPrice,foodAvailable,city} (build WHERE)
      → CollegeRepository.findById (resolve college)
      → HostelRepository.findAll(spec)           [DB: filtered, unpaged]
      → DistanceService.haversineKm  × N          [Java: compute + sort]
      → manual subList pagination
      → HostelImageRepository.findFirst...        [DB: cover image per row]
  → PagedResponse<HostelListItemResponse>
```

**Authenticated write (`PATCH /api/bookings/{id}/confirm`, admin)**
```
JwtAuthFilter.doFilterInternal        [populates SecurityContext from JWT]
  → SecurityConfig's authorizeHttpRequests  [passes: not in permitAll list, but authenticated]
  → @PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')") on BookingController.confirm  [role check]
  → BookingController.confirm
      → BookingService.confirm
          → BookingRepository.findById           [load booking]
          → status check (must be PENDING)
          → HostelRepository.tryDecrementAvailableCapacity  [ATOMIC UPDATE, the race-condition fix]
          → booking.setStatus(CONFIRMED)
          → BookingRepository.save
  → BookingResponse
```

